    "text": "<div class=\"card mb-4\">\n            <div class=\"card-body\">\n                <p>Choose from the options A to E the one that is the MOST APPROPRIATE INTERPRETATION for each of the following statements.<br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <p>After the successful operation, he recovered by leaps and bound.<br>\nThis means &nbsp;___________</p>",
