    "correctOptionIndex": 0,
    "explanation": "The rule is to select a question that contrasts with&nbsp;the emphasized word/ or the word in capital letters. In this case, the word 'plant' contrasts with 'harvest'. Therefore the answer is A. Do the farmers harvest crops during the rainy season?",
