    "text": "<p>If the frequency of an emitted x-ray is 1.6 x 10\\(^{16}\\)Hz, the accelerating potential is?<br>\n[e = 1.6 x 10\\(^{19}\\)C, h = 6.63 x 10\\(^{-34}\\)Js]</p>",
